Z||000006||Fformula88||01-01-2001||10:47 PM||||There is a guage difference too, even between four cylinders.  Inside the 4 cyl tach in 84 was I believe an amp guage.  Correct me if I am wrong!  But the 85-88 4 cyl's had an oil pressure guage there instead and only a warning light for the amps.  The V6's have both guages on the auxiliary pod above the radio.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Alex2004||01-01-2001||11:06 PM||||Yea, 84's have the amp gauge.||||reg||1
