Z||000010||fiero56||01-02-2001||06:31 PM||||All '86-'88 v-6 instrument pods are backlit, 85mph as well as 120mph. All 4-cyl, and '85 v-6 gauges are reflector. 4-cyl never came with 120mph speedo. v-6 tach uses a different pulse count I think.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-02-2001).]||||reg||1
